            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "+--------------------+-------------------+-------------------+----------------------------+-----------+----------+----------+-------------------+\n|Formatted Date_count| Formatted Date_min| Formatted Date_max|Formatted Date_countDistinct|fecha_count| fecha_min| fecha_max|fecha_countDistinct|\n+--------------------+-------------------+-------------------+----------------------------+-----------+----------+----------+-------------------+\n|               96453|2005-12-31 23:00:00|2016-12-31 22:00:00|                       96429|      96453|2005-12-31|2016-12-31|               4019|\n+--------------------+-------------------+-------------------+----------------------------+-----------+----------+----------+-------------------+\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mdateColsNames\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mArray[String]\u001b[0m = Array(Formatted Date, fecha)\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mstatsExprs\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mArray[org.apache.spark.sql.Column]\u001b[0m = Array(count(Formatted Date) AS `Formatted Date_count`, min(Formatted Date) AS `Formatted Date_min`, max(Formatted Date) AS `Formatted Date_max`, count(Formatted Date) AS `Formatted Date_countDistinct`, count(fecha) AS fecha_count, min(fecha) AS fecha_min, max(fecha) AS fecha_max, count(fecha) AS fecha_countDistinct)\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mdfStatsDateCols\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [Formatted Date_count: bigint, Formatted Date_min: timestamp ... 6 more fields]\n"
